      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercer%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first train arrived in Mercer in 1894, signaling the beginning of the town's early settlers, roads, and businesses.",
